{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04019","headline":"饯郢州李使君 · 苏頲","name":"饯郢州李使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚有章华台，遥遥云梦泽。\n复闻拥符传，及是收图籍。\n佳政在离人，能声寄侯伯。\n离怀朔风起，试望秋阴积。\n中路凄以寒，羣山霭将夕。\n伤心聊把袂，怊怅麒麟客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}